+        // Touge: onDisconnect (NimBLE task) wakes this thread with setIntervalFromNow(0), but if that
+        // lands while runOnce is executing, OSThread::run overwrites it with the value returned here
+        // and the advertising restart is never serviced: the radio goes dark until it reboots. A
